# The frontend's one setting, for `npm run build` or a GitHub Actions variable.
# Vite reads a .env in this folder, so leaving this commented out keeps local
# builds browser-only. Backend settings live in services/.env.example.
#
# The backend's address, fixed into the build. Empty or unset: the browser-only
# app, with no Extract tab and nothing ever uploaded. Never put a token or
# password in a VITE_ variable: everything in one ends up public.
# VITE_INVOICE_API_URL=https://invoices.example.com/api
